# Hugging Face payloads; Git tracks their cards, manifests and export code.
release/model/*.safetensors
release/model/tokenizer/
release/dataset/**/*.jsonl
release/dataset/**/*.jsonl.gz
release/dataset/**/*.parquet
release/dataset/**/*.arrow
release/dataset/**/*.zip
!release/dataset/document-attribution.jsonl
